  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Spicy chicken patties come together with ground chicken, garlic, ginger, chili flakes, smoky paprika, and a splash of bright citrus, all held in a creamy coconut yogurt mixture that keeps every bite tender and juicy. As they sizzle in the pan, the aroma wraps around your kitchen, and those crisp golden edges give way to a fiery center that wakes up your taste buds. Tuck your spicy chicken patties into cool lettuce cups or soft buns, load them with your favorite toppings, and every bite feels fun, bold, and endlessly satisfying.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#why-youll-love-this-spicy-chicken-patties\">Why You’ll Love This spicy chicken patties</a></li><li><a href=\"#ingredients\">Ingredients</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-make-spicy-chicken-patties\">How to Make Spicy Chicken Patties</a></li><li><a href=\"#recipe-snapshot\">Recipe Snapshot</a></li><li><a href=\"#pro-tips-for-making-spicy-chicken-patties\">Pro Tips for Making spicy chicken patties</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-serve-this-spicy-chicken-patties\">How to Serve this spicy chicken patties</a></li><li><a href=\"#make-ahead-and-storage\">Make Ahead and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"#final-thoughts\">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-youll-love-this-spicy-chicken-patties\"><strong>Why You’ll Love This spicy chicken patties</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Perfectly spicy kick that excites your taste buds.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Juicy and tender texture that keeps you coming back for more.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Quick and easy to make, ideal for busy weeknights.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Versatile for sandwiches, salads, or as a snack.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div id=\"wprm-recipe-container-7639\" class=\"wprm-recipe-container\" data-recipe-id=\"7639\" data-servings=\"4\"><div class=\"w